-- ============================================================================
-- ATS — V002: seed roles, permission catalog, default grants, modules
-- The default grants are a starting point; the System Administrator changes
-- them from the Roles & Permissions screen without touching code.
-- The first admin user is created by the application at startup, not here,
-- so no password hash ever lives in a script.
-- ============================================================================

